# tally 2.2.1 R20 clause 1 (OPERATIONS §2.1; P4 reopened): run prints the refused scenarios' lines in check's order, by
# first file: twin before alpha; then the results. tally 2.2 printed them by scenario id.
=== model.tally
model plain
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "T's base for M3's check fixtures (invented): it loads clean with no warning; each fixture of fixtures.tsv adds files to it"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input amt: money PLN

def doubled: money PLN = amt + amt at reader

ask q: doubled law 2026-03-01

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
=== p12/b/t1.tally
scenario twin over plain
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01
=== p12/c/lost.tally
scenario alpha over nowhere
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01
=== p12/d/t2.tally
scenario twin over plain
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01
=== expect
scenario twin: refused: LOAD-SCENARIO scenario twin declared twice (p12/d/t2.tally:1)
scenario alpha: refused: LOAD-SCENARIO scenario alpha is over nowhere, neither the model nor a scenario (p12/c/lost.tally:1)
q: 200.00 PLN
  law date 2026-03-01, cut 2026-03-01
